# Email sent to a Vireo user after the password on that user's account
# changes, whether the user changed it or a reset link was redeemed.
#
# Parameters: {CHANGE_TIME} is expanded to the time of the change
#
Subject: Vireo Password Changed
The password on your Vireo account was changed on {CHANGE_TIME}.

If you made this change, no action is needed.

If you did not make this change, please email etd-support@jhu.edu right
away so we can help you secure your account.

The Hopkins ETD Team
